return {h=12,w=150,cr=60,hc=30,bh=70,gr="fast-then-very-slow",eg={"indeterminate"},st={150,80,44,90,54,80},ab={{106,0},{84,0},{138,1}},genus={en="Blimp Pokémon",es="Pokémon Dirigible",pt="Pokémon Dirigível"},flavor={en={[12]="It’s drowzy in daytime, but flies off in the evening in big groups. No one knows where they go.",[13]="It carries people and Pokémon when it flies. But since it only drifts, it can end up anywhere.",[14]="At dusk, swarms of them are carried aloft on winds. When noticed, they suddenly vanish.",[15]="It can generate and release gas within its body. That’s how it can control the altitude of its drift.",[16]="It can generate and release gas within its body. That’s how it can control the altitude of its drift.",[17]="At dusk, swarms of them are carried aloft on winds. When noticed, they suddenly vanish.",[18]="At dusk, swarms of them are carried aloft on winds. When noticed, they suddenly vanish.",[21]="They carry people and Pokémon, but the wind can catch them, so there can’t be a fixed destination.",[22]="They carry people and Pokémon, but the wind can catch them, so there can’t be a fixed destination.",[23]="It carries people and Pokémon when it flies. But since it only drifts, it can end up anywhere.",[24]="It’s drowsy in daytime, but flies off in the evening in big groups. No one knows where they go.",[25]="It carries people and Pokémon when it flies. But since it only drifts, it can end up anywhere.",[26]="It’s drowsy in daytime, but flies off in the evening in big groups. No one knows where they go.",[27]="There was once an incident in which a man took a trip riding a Drifblim, only to go missing.",[28]="Even while under careful observation, large flocks of Drifblim flying at dusk will inexplicably disappear from view.",[29]="There’s a rumor that if you catch a Drifblim floating on the wind at dusk, you’ll be carried away to the afterlife.",[30]="The raw material for the gas inside its body is souls. When its body starts to deflate, it’s thought to carry away people and Pokémon.",[33]="Some say this Pokémon is a collection of souls burdened with regrets, silently drifting through the dusk.",[34]="It grabs people and Pokémon and carries them off somewhere. Where do they go? Nobody knows.",[39]="It drifts along at dusk, perfectly silent. Its transient, melancholy aspect touches some people deeply, every so often, one will come upon a song or poem devoted to Drifblim."},es={[23]="Transporta a gente y a Pokémon volando, pero, como se deja llevar, puede acabar en cualquier sitio.",[24]="Durante el día está somnoliento, pero por la noche sale volando en grupo, aunque nadie sabe adónde.",[25]="Transporta a gente y a Pokémon volando, pero, como se deja llevar, puede acabar en cualquier sitio.",[26]="Durante el día está somnoliento, pero por la noche sale volando en grupo, aunque nadie sabe adónde.",[27]="Hubo un caso de un chico que se subió a un Drifblim y salió de viaje. Desde entonces está en paradero desconocido.",[28]="Al anochecer, se reúnen en grupos y vuelan a la deriva. Si alguien trata de seguirlos con la mirada, desaparecen al instante.",[29]="Se rumorea que los Drifblim que surcan el cielo al ocaso llevan a todos aquellos que atrapan al más allá.",[30]="El gas que alberga su interior se compone de almas. Si su cuerpo se deshincha, arrastra consigo tanto a personas como a Pokémon.",[33]="Se dice que está formado por almas en pena. Al caer la noche, flota a la deriva en silencio sepulcral.",[34]="Agarra a gente y a Pokémon para llevárselos a algún sitio, aunque nadie sabe exactamente adónde."},pt="Flutua ao entardecer em completo silêncio. Seu ar passageiro e melancólico comove algumas pessoas profundamente, e de vez em quando surge uma canção ou um poema dedicado a Drifblim."},evo={{s=425},{s=426,from=425,c={{t="level-up",lv=28}}}},moves={[8]={1,132,1,107,1,310,1,16,6,310,11,16,14,116,17,371,22,254,27,256,27,255,32,466,37,226,44,247,51,153},[9]={1,132,1,107,1,310,1,16,6,310,11,16,14,116,17,371,22,254